# then switch into an answer-seeking phase that nudges a natural left delimiter.
# Once a left delimiter appears, stay in constrained decoding and allow the LM
# to naturally close the span with a right delimiter. Maintain a real
# closed_spans counter so the strategy can distinguish an actually closed span
# from merely being inside an open one. For GSM, prefer a single delayed final
# verified span and stop after the first naturally closed span.
# CSD_RATIONALE_END
